@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@tokenResponsible = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJhdXRoMCIsInVzZXJuYW1lIjoibWFuYWdlciIsImlhdCI6MTc3Mjk4NDI4MiwiZXhwIjoxNzczMDcwNjgyfQ.CaWuGQLW9547D2q65CVYE_74SuX8g3wlX0eETMt8uHE

### Submit selection - success (should return 201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/1/selection
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenResponsible}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberIds": [1, 2, 3, 4]
}

### Submit selection - wrong number of players (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/1/selection
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenResponsible}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberIds": [1, 2, 3]
}

### Submit selection - match not found (should return 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/999/selection
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenResponsible}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberIds": [1, 2, 3, 4]
}

### Submit selection - member not in team (should return 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/1/selection
Authorization: Bearer {{tokenResponsible}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberIds": [1, 2, 3, 999]
}

### Submit selection - unauthorized (should return 403)
POST {{baseUrl}}/matches/1/selection
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "memberIds": [1, 2, 3, 4]
}
